  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or perpetuate racist tropes, particularly those who engage with or enjoy content that uses hypersexualization and racial objectification of Black men. This includes communities that may find humor or satisfaction in dehumanizing stereotypes, such as 'farm equipment and livestock' metaphors, and who may be drawn to content that reinforces racial hierarchy and subordination. The meme is designed to appeal to those who hold or are entertained by anti-Black stereotypes, particularly those that portray Black men as inferior, animalistic, and subordinate to white women.",
